      "output": "`REQUIREMENTS.md` has been written to the project root. Here's a summary of what was produced:\n\n**Feature**: About Company Page for the Stellar Horizons space-tourism website\n\n**Key decisions captured**:\n- **Static page** — no API calls, no loading/error states needed\n- **Reuses existing UI components** (Hero, FeaturesGrid, FeatureCard, MissionStrip, CtaBanner, SectionWrapper) — consistent with Landing and Contact page patterns\n- **P0 scope**: Route registration, hero, mission/vision, values grid (3–6 cards), CTA banner → Contact, responsive layout, E2E tests\n- **P1 scope**: Company story/history section, team/leadership section\n- **5 E2E test scenarios** defined following existing Playwright patterns\n- **5 open questions** documented (content specifics, assets, team section priority)\n\nThe document follows the mandatory 13-section template (Sections 0–12) with Given/When/Then acceptance criteria for all 4 user stories.",
